From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscanerGang <escaner@zaryxstudios.dev>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:58:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(knockback): add configurable per-world knockback system

- Introduce OmegaKnockbackController to manage per-world knockback profiles and persistence
- Add enabled toggle and sanitization logic to OmegaSpigotWorldConfig to validate knockback values
- Integrate knockback checks into EntityLiving and EntityHuman to respect world configuration
- Replace invalid knockback values with safe defaults and log warnings per world
- Initialize knockback configuration during config loading and register controller instance

